match: [Mm]igrat
think 1
say Running the orders migration against staging.
tool Bash npm run migrate -- --env staging
out applying 0007_add_currency.sql
out applying 0008_backfill_totals.sql
out ERROR: column "currency" of relation "orders" already exists
tool Read db/migrations/0007_add_currency.sql
out Read 4 lines
say 0007 was applied by hand on staging. The migration needs a guard.
tool Edit db/migrations/0007_add_currency.sql
add ALTER TABLE orders ADD COLUMN IF NOT EXISTS currency text;
tool Bash npm run migrate -- --env staging
out ERROR: connect ECONNREFUSED staging-db.acme.internal:5432
say Staging's database is not reachable from this machine.
sh hook error
